 4.2 Remove approx.250 ml of the suspension from both the nozzles together in 
     bottle or glass container and discard.
 4.3 Initially, check sealing quality of 5 filled & sealed vials:- Ckd by :_____

  5. a) Vacuum Test : 
  ======================
  Carry out Vacuum Test on 2 units from individual sealing heads  
  in supine position for 5 minutes (containing  product). No units should leak        
  In case of leakage observed, rectify head & perform the same test.
  When vacuum test is O.K., continue the filling and sealing.
  b) Elevated Temp. Test :
  ============================
  Subject the units passing in above vacuum test to elevated temp. test at 50øC
  in supine position for minimum 12 hours. No units should leak. Ckd. By___________        
  c)   No. of sprays per vials :_______________
  ============================
ENDTEXT
